            <ArticleTitle>[Assessment of the the physical loading tolerance of ischemic heart disease patients in relation to different sites of the coronary artery lesion].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>55-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An analysis of physical exercise tolerance in CHD patients with the equal number of affected coronary arteries with relation to a coronary bed region involved in a pathological process, showed that its decrease was mostly pronounced in vasoconstriction of the left coronary arterial system and was determined by a decrease in the blood flow in this region.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
